From 1f93388aec0d546686a8e2cd0a0386b5c511f49b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Jul 2026 08:40:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add joint_kinematics_publisher_node: live per-joint
 pos/vel/accel

Joint-space counterpart of tool_pose_publisher_node. Subscribes to
/joint_states and publishes, per joint, ~/<joint>/position, ~/<joint>/velocity
and ~/<joint>/acceleration as std_msgs/Float64 for live plotting (PlotJuggler).

Velocity and acceleration are differentiated from position with the same
EMA-smoothed, decimated scheme proven in joint_monitor_node, since the Gazebo
position controller zeroes msg.velocity every cycle. A use_msg_velocity
parameter lets a real driver's velocity be trusted instead. Registered as a
console_scripts entry point in setup.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KQCxcPgc9uLhLET2DQtPna
